I think that works. Curious though, can't the `dialog` rules just be this:

```
dialog:modal::backdrop {
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
}
```

It can only be `:modal`, even if it matches `[popover]`, if it got there via `showModal()`. Right?

